# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 本地构建 / devcheck 生成物（分层说明见 tools/devcheck/README.md）
#   源码快照与检查脚本入库，下面这些每次跑都会重建
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
src-tauri/target/
tools/devcheck/rust/*/target/
tools/devcheck/rust/*/src/gen/
tools/devcheck/front/gen/
tools/devcheck/front/node_modules/
tools/devcheck/front/.prettierrc
tools/devcheck/_selftest/
tools/devcheck/front/_selftest/
# -SelfTest 的仓库内改动锁与备份（进程被杀后靠它们恢复并清场）
tools/devcheck/.repo-lock
tools/devcheck/.selftest-backup/
# 构建产物：kirara-builder.exe 由 build.ps1 生成，CI 里用 artifact / cache 传递
tools/*.exe
tools/*.pdb
